        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Prudential standards Part 3A ",
            "block_bbox": [
                728,
                28,
                1023,
                50
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Section 34E ",
            "block_bbox": [
                877,
                115,
                1022,
                139
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "34E Notice of determination, variation or revocation of certain prudential standards ",
            "block_bbox": [
                152,
                178,
                945,
                238
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) If APRA determines or varies a prudential standard referred to in paragraph 34C(1)(e) or (f), APRA must give a copy of the standard or of the variation to each RSE licensee and connected entity to.which the standard applies.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                250,
                261,
                1020,
                370
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) If APRA revokes a prudential standard referred to in paragraph 34C(1)(e) or (f), APRA must give notice of the revocation to each RSE licensee and connected entity to which the.standard applies.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                251,
                393,
                1015,
                503
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "34F APRA to monitor prudential matters.",
            "block_bbox": [
                154,
                537,
                687,
                563
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The functions of APRA include:.",
            "block_bbox": [
                293,
                587,
                650,
                609
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) collecting and analysing information on prudential matters concerning RSE licensees of registrable superannuation entities and connected entities of RSE licensees of registrable superannuation entities; and \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                309,
                622,
                1030,
                731
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) encouraging and promoting the carrying out of sound practices in relation to prudential matters by RSE licensees of registrable superannuation entities and connected entities of.RSE licensees of registrable superannuation entities; and.",
            "block_bbox": [
                307,
                741,
                1038,
                848
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) evaluating the effectiveness and carrying out of those practices.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                309,
                858,
                948,
                911
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
